        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>刚从长沙回来总结 - 3天2晚 1000元</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fdfaf3;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdfaf3;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  /* Title */\n  .title-bar {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 0 12px 0;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #4a7fb5;\n  }\n  .title-bar h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 52px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    color: #111111;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #111;\n  }\n  .title-bar h1 .blue {\n    color: #5aa9e6;\n  }\n  /* Subtitle */\n  .subtitle {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #d94f3d;\n    padding: 10px 0 6px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  /* Main layout */\n  .content {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  /* Left timeline column */\n  .timeline {\n    width: 116px;\n    flex: 0 0 116px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding-top: 30px;\n  }\n  .tl-label {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #111111;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .arrow {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 60px;\n    margin: 14px 0;\n    background: #a8d0ef;\n    clip-path: polygon(30% 0%, 70% 0%, 70% 62%, 100% 62%, 50% 100%, 0% 62%, 30% 62%);\n  }\n  /* Right rows */\n  .rows {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 6px;\n    padding-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 172px;\n    height: 118px;\n    flex: 0 0 172px;\n    background: #e6e6e6;\n    border: 1px solid #c9c9c9;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #666;\n    padding: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .info {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n  }\n  .spot {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #2b6cb0;\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .time {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .time .lab {\n    color: #e0574a;\n  }\n  .desc {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">\n    <h1>刚从<span class=\"blue\">长沙</span>回来总结</h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">3天2晚&nbsp;&nbsp;1000元</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"timeline\">\n      <div class=\"tl-label\">第一天</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-label\">上午</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-label\">下午</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\"></div>\n      <div class=\"tl-label\">晚上</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rows\">\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 五一广场夜景，红色气球，\"LOVE CS\"字样]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <p class=\"spot\">🌟五一广场（免费）</p>\n          <p class=\"time\"><span class=\"lab\">游玩时间：</span>2h</p>\n          <p class=\"desc\">长沙商圈老大，就近可打卡IFS国金中心、黄兴路步行街、坡子街等</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 南门口街道建筑与招牌]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <p class=\"spot\">🌟南门口（免费）</p>\n          <p class=\"time\"><span class=\"lab\">游玩时间：</span></p>\n          <p class=\"desc\">南门口是很多长沙人生活的地方，附近有很多地道的美食和小吃</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 橘子洲头青年毛泽东雕像]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <p class=\"spot\">🌟橘子洲（免费）</p>\n          <p class=\"time\"><span class=\"lab\">游玩时间：</span>2h</p>\n          <p class=\"desc\">我个人是不推荐橘子洲和岳麓山放在同一天的，傍晚的橘子洲更有韵味</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 湘江夜游游轮]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <p class=\"spot\">🌟湘江游轮（180/人）</p>\n          <p class=\"time\"><span class=\"lab\">游玩时间：</span>1h</p>\n          <p class=\"desc\">夜游湘江绝对是一种不容错过的体验，江风清爽，夜景特别美</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 杜甫江阁夜景灯光]</figure>\n        <div class=\"info\">\n          <p class=\"spot\">🌟杜甫江阁（10/人）</p>\n          <p class=\"time\"><span class=\"lab\">游玩时间：</span>1h</p>\n          <p class=\"desc\">为纪念杜甫江阁而建，夜景美，是观看湘江夜景的最佳观景地点</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
